graph TD
    %% Top-level UI and API
    UI[Support UI]
    API[API Gateway]
    SUP[Support Microservice]

    %% Subgraph for Support Modules
    subgraph Support_Features
        FAQ[FAQ]
        Tutorials[Tutorials]
        Docs[Documentation]
        Contact[Contact Support]
        ChatBot[AI Support Chat Bot]
        Release[Release Notes]
        Email[Email Request]
    end

    %% User interaction flow
    UI -->|Support Requests| API
    API --> SUP

    %% Support microservice contains modules
    SUP --> Support_Features

    %% Interactions between modules
    Contact --> ChatBot
    ChatBot -->|Automated Response| Contact
    Email -->|Send Meeting Request| TeamMember[Team Member Email]
